.\" Manual page of amcset-gui. Part of AMCSET (GPL-3.0-or-later).
.TH AMCSET-GUI 1 "@AMCSET_RELEASE_DATE@" "AMCSET @PROJECT_VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
amcset\-gui \- set up, run and view AMCSET ion transport simulations
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B amcset\-gui
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ scenario.json | TRIM.IN | results.json ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B amcset\-gui
is the graphical program of AMCSET, a Monte Carlo simulator of ion transport
and radiation damage in layered amorphous and crystalline targets (SRIM
mode: SRIM-2013's TRIM reproduced). It edits a scenario (ion, target layers,
crystals, calculation, output), runs it on all processor cores, and shows the
ion and recoil paths in 3D, TRIM's plots, tables and statistics while the
calculation runs. A file given on the command line is opened.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-run
Start the calculation at once.
.TP
.BI \-\-screenshots " DIR"
After the calculation, save images of the views to DIR.
.TP
.B \-\-quit
Quit when the calculation ends.
.TP
.BI \-\-timeout " SECONDS"
With
.BR \-\-run :
exit with status 3 after SECONDS.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show the options.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Show the version.
.PP
Qt's own options (for example
.BR \-platform )
are accepted as well.
.SH SIGNALS
SIGTERM, SIGHUP and SIGINT stop a running calculation and close the program
without questions (unsaved changes to the scenario are lost); the exit status
is 128 plus the signal number. When the desktop session ends (log-off,
shutdown), the program closes without asking; a scenario with unsaved
changes is kept in ~/.local/share/AMCSET/AMCSET/recovery/, and the next
start says so.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B AMCSET_RHI
Graphics API of the path views: opengl, vulkan (Windows also d3d11, d3d12).
.TP
.B AMCSET_DATA_DIR
A directory with the stopping tables, searched before the installed ones.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/AMCSET/AMCSET.conf
Settings (window layout, recent files).
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/AMCSET/AMCSET/logs/
The program's log.
.SH COPYRIGHT
Copyright 2025 Texas A&M University. License GPL-3.0-or-later. The bundled
SRIM-2013 stopping tables are derived from SRIM (J. F. Ziegler) and are free
for non-commercial use only.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR amcset (1)
.PP
https://github.com/Shao-RMSGAL/AMCSET
